Revision history for Data-Coloured

{{$NEXT}}
  - A multi-byte UTF-8 character is now rendered from its UTF-8 bytes instead
    of its code point, so "ä" shows up as <c3a4> and not as <e4>.
  - The distribution builds from the source tree and ships the Perl 5 licence
    as a committed LICENSE file.
  - README.md documents the module, its two export tiers and all four functions.
  - Continuous integration runs on GitHub Actions for Perl 5.36, 5.38 and 5.40.
